DESCRIPTION:Jason Choi is a New York-based comedian who has been featured o
 n Don't Tell Comedy. He was a finalist at the Boston Comedy Festival and th
 e New York Comedy Club Fall Invitational\, and chosen as one of NY's Funnie
 st for the New York Comedy Festival 2025. He's also appeared at the Asian C
 omedy Festival\, Tiny Cupboard Festival\, and SF Sketchfest 2023. In 2026 h
 e made his network TV debut on CBS's Comic's Unleashed. He’s also the 'An
 gry Sony Fanboy'\, a minor internet meme of 2006.Presented by the New York 
 Comedy Festival.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/an-
